   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<h3>你需要的材料或工具：</h3><p>一块130x85cm的布料（用来做圣诞袜）<br />一块80x40cm的布料（用来做圣诞袜的翻边）<br />剪刀<br />粉笔或者铅笔<br />缝纫机</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "动图：制作过程的第一步。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/aa/87/aa87c27514b9024e5793980daaa3e8f8.gif"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/aa/87/aa87c27514b9024e5793980daaa3e8f8.gif",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>第1步</strong>拿出用来做圣诞袜的布料，沿纵向对折。用粉笔或铅笔画出圣诞袜的轮廓，同时要确保将布料对折的一边作为袜子平直的一侧。沿着轮廓线裁剪。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "动图：制作过程的第二步。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/b1/bc/b1bc682ebf64aec56969ca49e43dc942.gif"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/b1/bc/b1bc682ebf64aec56969ca49e43dc942.gif",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>第2步</strong>展开刚刚剪下来的圣诞袜。拿出那块80x40cm的布料，跟刚剪好的圣诞袜缝在一起，就做出了圣诞袜的翻边。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "动图：制作过程的第三步。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/45/af/45af1b65ae5bccca1bf65762081e5269.gif"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/45/af/45af1b65ae5bccca1bf65762081e5269.gif",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>第3步</strong>圣诞袜的翻边已经做出来了，然后把圣诞袜重新叠回去，把弯曲的一侧缝上。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "动图：制作过程的最后一步。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/52/1d/521dbf091ac2dd1e14ecbcaa3e0a60be.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/52/1d/521dbf091ac2dd1e14ecbcaa3e0a60be.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>第4步</strong>把整个圣诞袜翻个面，就看不见接缝处了，再把长袜的顶部翻个边，做出一个漂亮的袜口（你还可以把袜口缝成你喜欢的样子）。大功告成！</p>"
   ],
